{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SnIsotypicSpechtSplitInstance","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.OVTopAssembly","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BurnsideDischarge","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PlancherelNormalisation"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.tiltNorm_zero_eq_factorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.tiltNorm_zero_eq_factorial","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L75-L78","doc":"**The Plancherel tilt normalisation at zero, with no hypothesis.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.nuV_top_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.nuV_top_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L63-L73","doc":"**The (TAIL) first instance, with no hypothesis** — `ν_n = n(n−2)(n−3)·C(2n−4, n−2)/(3·n!)`.\n\n`PlancherelNormalisation.nuV_top_closed_form_unconditional` is \"unconditional\" in the sense that it\ndischarges `nuV_top_closed_form`'s named normalisation premise; it still carries the class. Here\nthat is gone too. The `r + 2 ≤ 20` bound is a separate, genuine cap of the tail machinery and is\n**not** discharged by the instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.burnside_proved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.burnside_proved","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L56-L61","doc":"**Burnside over the custom partition encoding, with no hypothesis.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.sum_numSYT_sq_eq_factorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.sum_numSYT_sq_eq_factorial","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L51-L54","doc":"**The Wedderburn dimension sum, with no hypothesis.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.sn_isotypic_specht_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WedderburnUnconditional.sn_isotypic_specht_split","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WedderburnUnconditional.lean#L38-L49","doc":"**The keystone, with no hypothesis.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}